      "text": "Deployment and Runtime Topology\nLocal: frontend:3000 -> backend:8000 -> db:5434->5432\nCloud: S3 + CloudFront + Lambda Function URL + Aurora\nTerraform: function discovery + env var injection\nSecurity: IAM invoke, OAC, X-Workshop-Token gate\nRuntime: Mangum adapter + service DB init at cold start",
